herdr-mods

files-md/mods/files-md, changes-editor/mods/changes-editor,
spaces-keys/mods/spaces-keys and agents-keys/mods/agents-keys (and their copies
in custom-herdr/mods) are modified copies of the `files`, `changes`, `spaces`
and `agents` mods shipped with the Herdr app (https://herdr.dev), which are licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. Changes:

- files-md: renders markdown files (Preview / Source toggle) and adds an
  "Open in <editor>" button for the shown file.
- changes-editor: adds an "Open in <editor>" button for the selected changed
  file.
- spaces-keys: shows the key bound to `space.select:<n>` on each space's row.
- agents-keys: shows the `agent.next` / `agent.prev` keys on the rows they
  reach from the focused agent.

custom-herdr/layouts/custom-herdr.json is a modified copy of the Herdr app's
`main` layout.

